<ptxt>Drive at a vehicle speed of 70 to 120km/h (engine speed 1400-3200r/min) for 3 to 5 minutes. (*1)</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>The malfunction cannot be confirmed unless the test is performed properly.</ptxt>
